<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Plantations yr net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Plantations yr net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		82.01	vs	  17.10</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)  25.5	 vs	   6.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		 161.99	vs	  10.29</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 128.40	vs	  32.06</p>
<p>    Minorities    less     2.76	vs  less   0.29</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  0.73	vs	   3.02</p>
<p>    Dividend     (cents)   2.0	 vs	   1.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysian Plantations Bhd is involved in securities dealing and broking and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
